    "narration": "On February 1st, 2024, somewhere in the Red Sea, a missile is arcing toward a container ship called the Koi. It misses \u2014 barely. The ship isn't owned by a government, and it isn't carrying weapons. It's chartered by a French shipping company most people have never heard of, hauling the same boring cargo it hauls every week: furniture, electronics, clothes, the stuff in your house right now.",
