    "narration": "This video isn't really about the missile. It's about how that company \u2014 CMA CGM \u2014 quietly became one of the most powerful players in global trade, and how a war that should have hurt it made it richer than it had ever been. To understand how, we have to go back to a single ship, in 1978.",
