    "narration": "So it kept buying. A stake in France's largest last-mile delivery firm. An automotive logistics company. Its own air cargo airline. 4.85 billion euros for Bollor\u00e9 Logistics. And, this year, 1.4 billion for FedEx's contract logistics arm. Add it up and CMA CGM can now touch a shipment from a factory floor in Vietnam to a doorstep in Ohio without handing it off to anyone else, ever.",
