  {
    "start": 164.0625,
    "end": 193.17499999999998,
    "narration": "Here's the detail that makes all of it possible. Maersk trades on the Copenhagen stock exchange and answers to shareholders every quarter. CMA CGM doesn't answer to anyone \u2014 almost three-quarters of it is still owned by the Saad\u00e9 family. Jacques handed the company to his son Rodolphe in 2017 and died the following year. Every acquisition since has happened on the family's own terms. No earnings call. No outside board to convince.",
