    "narration": "Which brings us back to that missile. Within hours of the strike on the Koi, CMA CGM rerouted every one of its Red Sea services around the Cape of Good Hope \u2014 adding up to two weeks and roughly a million dollars to every single Asia-to-Europe voyage. Every major carrier followed within months. Suez Canal revenue for Egypt collapsed from over ten billion dollars in 2023 to around four billion in 2024, as the world's busiest shipping shortcut emptied out.",
